{"info": {"address1": "Electric Mansion", "address2": "6th Floor Appasaheb Marathe Marg Prabhadevi", "city": "Mumbai", "zip": "400025", "country": "India", "phone": "91 22 2430 6237", "fax": "91 22 2437 0624", "website": "https://www.bharatbijlee.com", "industry": "Electrical Equipment & Parts", "industryKey": "electrical-equipment-parts", "industryDisp": "Electrical Equipment & Parts", "sector": "Industrials", "sectorKey": "industrials", "sectorDisp": "Industrials", "longBusinessSummary": "Bharat Bijlee Limited operates as an electrical engineering company in India and internationally. It operates in two segments, Power Systems and Industrial Systems. The company is involved in the design, manufacture, commission, and marketing of power transformers; EPC projects for electrical substations, such as delivery, rectification, commissioning, and servicing of transformers; and marketing of maintenance products. It also develops, manufactures, and markets a range of standard and customized electric motors, including low and medium voltage motors, and SynchroVERT IE4 motors; and magnet technology machines, such as gearless belt machines for passenger lift, home elevators, and heavy-duty goods. In addition, the company engineers and supplies drives and automation systems, which include AC and Servo drive, and motion controllers. Further, the company undertakes turnkey projects, including switchyards. Bharat Bijlee Limited was incorporated in 1946 and is headquartered in Mumbai, India.", "fullTimeEmployees": 1081, "companyOfficers": [{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Nakul Prahlad Mehta", "age": 67, "title": "Vice Chairman & MD", "yearBorn": 1958, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 117859800, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Nikhil Jaisingh Danani", "age": 76, "title": "Vice Chairman & MD", "yearBorn": 1949, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 117859800, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Yogendra S. Agarwal", "t